  <hasMajorOutcomes rdf:resource="#interpret French language texts—written, audio, visual—in the light of French culture and society."/>
  <hasMajorOutcomes rdf:resource="#move with accuracy and skill between the English and French languages and cultures."/>
  <hasMajorOutcomes rdf:resource="#creatively apply language skills to a range of different contexts."/>
