  <hasMajorOutcomes rdf:resource="#demonstrate an intermediate level of musicianship in presentation of works within solo, small group and company settings."/>
  <hasMajorOutcomes rdf:resource="#apply skills in singing, acting, and dancing to music theatre performance."/>
  <hasMajorOutcomes rdf:resource="#articulate broad historical perspectives on the nature and contexts of music theatre works and their antecedents."/>
  <hasMajorOutcomes rdf:resource="#implement techniques in artistic self-management, entrepreneurship, and networking relevant to the music theatre industry."/>
  <hasMajorOutcomes rdf:resource="#demonstrate an experimental and creative orientation."/>
