  <hasMajorCode rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">MJD-SPNHB</hasMajorCode>
  <hasMajorTitle rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Spanish Studies</hasMajorTitle>
  <hasMajorSchool rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Humanities</hasMajorSchool>
  <hasMajorDescription rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Studying Spanish is not simply about learning a language—it's an experience that will open your mind to different cultures. Spanish Studies helps you achieve a functional level of competency in listening, speaking, writing and reading the Spanish language. Learning the language also introduces you to the cultural and intellectual accomplishments of people in the many Spanish-speaking countries around the world. This major is offered to beginners. During the course you will also study past and present literature, films and popular culture in Spanish, providing you with a holistic and stimulating cultural and educational experience.</hasMajorDescription>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

