  <hasMajorDescription rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">This major is for students who wish to develop their knowledge and skills in data analysis within a business context. Students will be given both statistical and computing analytic skills, but will also learn how to apply that to a range of commercial and economic situations. Students will also gain the written and oral communication skills necessary to impart their analysis to a range of business stakeholders.</hasMajorDescription>
