  <hasMajorCode rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">MJD-AGTDM</hasMajorCode>
  <hasMajorTitle rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Agricultural Science and Technology</hasMajorTitle>
  <hasMajorSchool rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Agriculture and Environment</hasMajorSchool>
  <hasMajorDescription rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">There is a critical need to produce food and fibre more efficiently and sustainably. There are now rapid changes in the agricultural sector, largely due to developments in agricultural technology. This extended major provides knowledge in both the traditional agricultural science areas as well as the emerging agricultural technologies, which are data intensive. The combination of Agricultural Science with Agricultural Technology will give students the ability to integrate new technologies into agricultural systems for improved decision making and farming efficiency/profitability. In this extended major you will develop skills in agricultural economics, soils, crops and livestock as well as remote sensing and data management and analysis, within an agricultural context.</hasMajorDescription>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

