  <hasOutcomeDescription rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">understand critically and reflexively the ethical, legislative, and occupational health and safety requirements involved in the study of the archaeology of death.</hasOutcomeDescription>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

