  <hasOutcomeDescription rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">evaluate the impact of climatic, physical, and environmental factors in the understanding of the settlement and occupation of Australia and the Indo-Pacific.</hasOutcomeDescription>
