  <hasOutcomeDescription rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">apply this critical understanding to their own societies, thereby demonstrating 'ethical sensitivity towards our diverse and globalised world'.</hasOutcomeDescription>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

