  <hasOutcomeDescription rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">refine generic skills in terms of information literacy and management—the study of Chinese language necessitates learning how to learn, from the use of bilingual and monolingual dictionaries to memorisation techniques.</hasOutcomeDescription>
