  <hasOutcomeDescription rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">demonstrate recall and mastery of classical Latin vocabulary and grammar through translation of passages of seen and unseen prose or verse without the aid of a dictionary.</hasOutcomeDescription>
