  <hasOutcomeDescription rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">demonstrate a critical understanding of the key issues underpinning the production and consumption of interactive- and trans-media experiences.</hasOutcomeDescription>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

<owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="#foster collaborative and professional interactive- and trans-media skills by engaging in team projects that simulate real-world scenarios.">
