  <hasOutcomeDescription rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">present convincing, coherent, and consistent oral and written summaries of the outcomes of research on transnational and organised crime and criminal organisations.</hasOutcomeDescription>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

