  <hasOutcomeDescription rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">relate their independent source interpretations to the complex historiographical debates about crime, criminals, law enforcement and penal structures.</hasOutcomeDescription>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

