  <hasUnitOutcomes rdf:resource="#describe methodologies to measure the effectiveness of therapeutic interventions."/>
  <hasUnitOutcomes rdf:resource="#recognise and critically analyse problems arising in the use of these methodologies."/>
  <hasUnitOutcomes rdf:resource="#assess strategies to address barriers to effective interventions."/>
  <hasUnitOutcomes rdf:resource="#apply this critical thinking to case management scenarios."/>
