  <hasOutcomeDescription rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">demonstrate an increased level of competency in all four macro skills—listening to, speaking, reading and writing French corresponding to proficiency Levels B2/C1 and upwards of the Common European Framework of Reference for Languages and.</hasOutcomeDescription>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

