  <hasOutcomeDescription rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">gain an increased level of competency in all four macro skills—listening to as well as speaking German, and reading and writing German corresponding to Levels B2/C1 and upwards of the Common European Framework of Reference for Languages.</hasOutcomeDescription>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

<owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="#develop an increased awareness of intercultural understanding and a greater sensitivity to modern German perspectives on world events.">
