  <hasUnitDescription rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Students enrolled in a German major can apply to study 12 points of German language and culture at the University of Stuttgart, Germany, during January and February. The program substitutes for two units at Level 2 and/or 3 in the German major, as determined by the major coordinator.</hasUnitDescription>
