  <hasOutcomeDescription rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">demonstrate a detailed understanding of the history of the History discipline since its establishment during the nineteenth century and a comprehension of major conceptual modes in 'thinking history'.</hasOutcomeDescription>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

