  <hasOutcomeDescription rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">demonstrate a detailed understanding of social, cultural and political change in Britain and Ireland from the eighteenth century onwards.</hasOutcomeDescription>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

