  <hasOutcomeDescription rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">to describe and assess the basic historiographical issues characteristic of the discipline of History through the example of historical writing on British imperial history.</hasOutcomeDescription>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

