  <hasOutcomeDescription rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">describe and assess the basic methodological characteristics of the history discipline through the study of the history of Christianity and its historiography.</hasOutcomeDescription>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

