  <hasOutcomeDescription rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">utilise digital tools to analyse and visualise different forms of artistic expression and material culture.</hasOutcomeDescription>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

<owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="#analyse and compare the advantages and limitations of various digital tools in the context of art historical research and museum collections and displays.">
