  <hasOutcomeDescription rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">locate the art of the Dutch Golden Age in the broader historical, cultural and political-economic context of globalisation.</hasOutcomeDescription>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

