  <hasUnitOutcomes rdf:resource="#discuss modern Italian texts, and relate them to their social and historical context.This requires students to read and understand."/>
  <hasUnitOutcomes rdf:resource="#demonstrate an enhanced awareness of the structures and use of the English language."/>
