<owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="#develop information literacy and management skills through a variety of media and search techniques, including the use of a dictionary. Additionally, through learning to express their ideas and performing assigned tasks in the Japanese language, students refine generic skills such as understanding self and others, understanding of language in general and critical analysis.">
