  <hasUnitOutcomes rdf:resource="#apply a variety of learning strategies relevant to the areas of syntax, semantics and phonetics."/>
  <hasUnitOutcomes rdf:resource="#have broader understanding of the Korean culture and society and how they inform everyday sociolinguistic conventions in contemporary Korean language."/>
  <hasUnitOutcomes rdf:resource="#achieve increased understanding of language and language use, in both Korean and English."/>
  <hasUnitOutcomes rdf:resource="#apply basic methods of linguistic and cultural analysis, particularly in relation to contrastive modes in language learning."/>
