  <hasOutcomeDescription rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">critically reflect on the ethical, social, and cultural implications of language-based AI systems, with particular attention to bias, inclusion, and accessibility.</hasOutcomeDescription>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

