  <hasUnitDescription rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">This practical unit builds on MUSC1752 Music Theatre Performance Skills 2 and extends musicianship, technical skills, and repertoire in music theatre performance.
The emphasis is upon further development and improvement of singing technique and performance skills (in singing, dancing, and acting) and performing more diverse repertoire. 
This unit prepares students for the next unit in the sequence, MUSC3752 Music Theatre Performance Skills 4.</hasUnitDescription>
