  <hasOutcomeDescription rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">creatively apply critical thinking and problem-solving skills to independently and collaboratively address challenges and issues in the global political economy.</hasOutcomeDescription>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

