  <hasOutcomeDescription rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">critically explain and evaluate relevant ideas, theories and concepts that seek to explain the Chinese politics and international relations.</hasOutcomeDescription>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

<owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="#creatively apply critical thinking and problem-solving skills to independently and collaboratively address changes, challenges and crises in China's reform and relations with the world.">
