  <hasOutcomeDescription rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">demonstrate a critical understanding of core concepts in the scholarly literature on international and comparative employment relations.</hasOutcomeDescription>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

