  <hasUnitDescription rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">This unit is concerned with the application of economic principles and methods to the decision-making process within the firm. Topics include game theory, pricing practices, corporate governance, privatisation and advertising.</hasUnitDescription>
