  <hasUnitOutcomes rdf:resource="#discover the theory and concepts underlying the inheritance of traits in prokaryotes and eukaryotes. Gain an appreciation of the social and historical context in which genetics has developed."/>
  <hasUnitOutcomes rdf:resource="#apply the technical and practical skills used in genetics laboratories through a series of integrated laboratory practicals."/>
  <hasUnitOutcomes rdf:resource="#apply the technical and communication skills of a bench scientist by the critical analysis and data presentation of integrated laboratory sessions."/>
