</owl:NamedIndividual>

<owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="#synthesise agronomic, environmental, financial, and crop protection knowledge to construct a professional agronomic management package for a major WA grain crop, including a gross margin analysis and a quantitative nitrogen management strategy.">
