  <hasOutcomeDescription rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">describe and explain the evolutionary framework for human biology, the basic principles of human genetics, the basic structure and function of the human body, reproduction in humans, and relate the biology of humans to their evolutionary history and embryological development.</hasOutcomeDescription>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

