  <hasOutcomeDescription rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">demonstrate an understanding of how vegetation mapping, inventory and interpretation of remotely sensed data require an understanding of vegetation structure.</hasOutcomeDescription>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

