  <hasOutcomeDescription rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">be able to critically assess both qualitative and quantitative environmental data to identify significant changes in environmental conditions.</hasOutcomeDescription>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

