  <hasOutcomeDescription rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">collect, assess and collate patient data to ascertain the risks and benefits of exercise participation in individuals with elevate burden of chronic disease.</hasOutcomeDescription>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

