  <hasOutcomeDescription rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">recognise interactions between nearshore coastal resilience, vulnerability and climate change and the need for a cross-disciplinary approach to nearshore coastal and marine conservation and management.</hasOutcomeDescription>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

<owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="#appreciate the varying nature of human threats to coastal and nearshore ecosystems and the driving forces behind these over space and time.">
