  <hasOutcomeDescription rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">explain how complex behaviours in individuals, cultures and societies are underpinned by brain function and organisation.</hasOutcomeDescription>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

