  <hasUnitOutcomes rdf:resource="#develop a fundamental understanding of the principles underlying mechanics, heat and thermodynamics, waves and optics, electricity and the breakdown of classical Physics."/>
  <hasUnitOutcomes rdf:resource="#apply critical thinking skills in a range of conceptual physical situations."/>
