  <hasUnitOutcomes rdf:resource="#analyse the concepts and physical principles involved in the foundations of special relativity, magnetism, electrical circuits and the physics of particles."/>
  <hasUnitOutcomes rdf:resource="#communicate ideas, both orally and in writing, relating to the foundations of special relativity, magnetism, electrical circuits and the physics of particles."/>
  <hasUnitOutcomes rdf:resource="#solve problems in a range of realistic situations relating to the foundations of special relativity, magnetism, electrical circuits and the physics of particles."/>
  <hasUnitOutcomes rdf:resource="#execute a series of experiments relevant to physics."/>
