  <hasUnitDescription rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">This unit covers the specialist mathematics required to pursue a major in engineering science, mathematics or physics. The unit provides students with a strong foundation in calculus, vectors, complex numbers and matrices.</hasUnitDescription>
