  <hasUnitOutcomes rdf:resource="#demonstrate an understanding of the accounting environment
and changing role of Accountants with respect to reporting on issues such as ICT."/>
  <hasUnitOutcomes rdf:resource="#show an ability to apply accounting vocabulary, principles and concepts."/>
  <hasUnitOutcomes rdf:resource="#prepare general purpose financial statements."/>
  <hasUnitOutcomes rdf:resource="#analyse transactions and prepare journals, ledgers and worksheets, and a Trial Balance."/>
  <hasUnitOutcomes rdf:resource="#appreciate internal control, corporate governance and the ethical issues affecting the work of accountants."/>
  <hasUnitOutcomes rdf:resource="#analyse and interpret financial statements."/>
  <hasUnitAssessments rdf:resource="#tutorial participation"/>
  <hasUnitAssessments rdf:resource="#assignment"/>
  <hasUnitAssessments rdf:resource="#examinations"/>
  <hasContactRequirement rdf:resource="#contactrequirement880"/>
  <hasUnitCode rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">ACCT1101</hasUnitCode>
  <hasUnitTitle rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Financial Accounting</hasUnitTitle>
  <hasUnitSchool rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">UWA Business School</hasUnitSchool>
  <hasUnitLevel rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">1</hasUnitLevel>
  <hasUnitDescription rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">This unit provides an introduction to financial reporting as well as a foundation for those who may later wish to specialise in accounting. No prior knowledge of the subject is required. Topics include the core concepts and practices underlying the preparation of financial statements, financial statement analysis and the factors in the business environment that influence the demand and supply of accounting information. The understanding of the business environment, measurement concepts and analytical skills gained through this unit are relevant to both accounting and non-accounting majors.</hasUnitDescription>
  <hasCreditPoints rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">6</hasCreditPoints>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

