  <hasOutcomeDescription rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">demonstrate basic data analytics and visualisation techniques that enhances the efficiency and effectiveness of communication.</hasOutcomeDescription>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

