  <hasOutcomeDescription rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">assess the difficulties involved in the application of the traditional privacy and jurisdiction doctrines to the Internet sphere.</hasOutcomeDescription>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

