  <hasOutcomeDescription rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">demonstrate understanding of the most effective scientific methods to understand the roots of prevalent public policy concerns.</hasOutcomeDescription>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

