  <hasUnitOutcomes rdf:resource="#demonstrate the ability to conduct and write a literature review regarding a specific HRM issue that draws on theoretical and empirical research."/>
  <hasUnitOutcomes rdf:resource="#demonstrate the ability to write a project proposal or report."/>
