  <hasOutcomeDescription rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">explain digital encoding and processing of information and discuss the associated benefits and limitations of digital design process abstractions.</hasOutcomeDescription>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

