  <hasUnitDescription rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Mechatronics is the integration of mechanical, electrical and software engineering.  In this project-based unit, students work in teams to design, build and test a mechatronics product that must satisfy a set of client-defined design requirements.  Students also learn about workshop safety and industry-standard design documentation.</hasUnitDescription>
