  <hasPrerequisiteText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Enrolment in Bachelor of Engineering (Honours) or an associated Combined Degree and  Successful completion of ( GENG2000 Engineering Practice 2 and ELEC3020 Embedded Systems ) or Enrolment in BP007 Bachelor of Automation and Robotics and  Successful completion of ENSC3020 Digital Embedded Systems</hasPrerequisiteText>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

