  <hasUnitDescription rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">This unit covers the theory of three-phase circuits, transformer models, DC and AC machines (synchronous and induction), equivalent circuits and performance relations (torque-speed relation, speed and voltage regulation, efficiency calculation).</hasUnitDescription>
