  <hasOutcomeDescription rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">apply leadership and management principles to guide a team through different project phases, evaluate team performance, and propose strategies to resolve conflict among team members.</hasOutcomeDescription>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

