  <hasOutcomeDescription rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">understand the dimensionless parameters that control a wide range of fluid mechanics phenomena, and use the principle of dynamic similarity to design models whose fluid mechanics replicate those of the prototype.</hasOutcomeDescription>
